3. Under section 5 of the West Pakistan Family Courts Act, 1964, the Family Court has exclusive jurisdiction to entertain, hear and adjudicate the following matters:‐‐‐

(i) Dissolution of marriage,

(ii) Dower;

(iii) Maintenance;

(iv) Restitution of conjugal rights;

(v) Custody of children;

(vi) Guardianship; and

(vii) Jactitation.
